          {
            "id": "6491447f",
            "elType": "widget",
            "settings": {
              "tabs": [
                {
                  "tab_title": "1. Discovery",
                  "tab_content": "<h3>Discovery and Planning</h3><div class='elementor-image-placeholder' style='background: #f1f5f9; height: 200px; margin: 20px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 2px dashed #cbd5e1;'>[IMAGE WIDGET PLACEHOLDER]</div><p>Every successful website starts with thorough planning. We begin by learning about your business, your target customers, and your specific goals for the website. We deliver a detailed project plan that outlines deliverables, timelines, and milestones.</p>",
                  "_id": ""
                },
                {
                  "tab_title": "2. UI/UX",
                  "tab_content": "<h3>UI/UX Design</h3><div class='elementor-image-placeholder' style='background: #f1f5f9; height: 200px; margin: 20px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 2px dashed #cbd5e1;'>[IMAGE WIDGET PLACEHOLDER]</div><p>Our designers create wireframes and high-fidelity mockups. This includes colour schemes aligned with your brand identity, typography, and imagery. For bilingual sites, we create separate designs for Arabic and English versions.</p>",
                  "_id": ""
                },
                {
                  "tab_title": "3. Development",
                  "tab_content": "<h3>Development and Integration</h3><div class='elementor-image-placeholder' style='background: #f1f5f9; height: 200px; margin: 20px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 2px dashed #cbd5e1;'>[IMAGE WIDGET PLACEHOLDER]</div><p>We build the functional website using modern frameworks like React, Vue.js, and Laravel. We connect your website to existing tools like ERP, CRM, and marketing automation platforms.</p>",
                  "_id": ""
                },
                {
                  "tab_title": "4. QA",
                  "tab_content": "<h3>Testing and Quality Assurance</h3><div class='elementor-image-placeholder' style='background: #f1f5f9; height: 200px; margin: 20px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 2px dashed #cbd5e1;'>[IMAGE WIDGET PLACEHOLDER]</div><p>Rigorous testing across functionality, performance, and security. We confirm cross-browser compatibility and cross-device display, including complete transaction testing for e-commerce sites.</p>",
                  "_id": ""
                },
                {
                  "tab_title": "5. Launch",
                  "tab_content": "<h3>Deployment and Launch</h3><div class='elementor-image-placeholder' style='background: #f1f5f9; height: 200px; margin: 20px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 2px dashed #cbd5e1;'>[IMAGE WIDGET PLACEHOLDER]</div><p>Deploying to your hosting environment with SSL, domain configuration, and performance optimization. We monitor the site closely post-launch and perform initial SEO setup.</p>",
                  "_id": ""
                },
                {
                  "tab_title": "6. Support",
                  "tab_content": "<h3>Ongoing Support</h3><div class='elementor-image-placeholder' style='background: #f1f5f9; height: 200px; margin: 20px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 2px dashed #cbd5e1;'>[IMAGE WIDGET PLACEHOLDER]</div><p>Applying security patches, updating plugins, monitoring uptime, and making content updates. Our maintenance packages are flexible to fit your specific technical needs.</p>",
                  "_id": ""
                }
